==English==

===Etymology===
{{L.}} [[circum]], "[[around]]"; [[scribere]] "to [[write]]"

===Verb===
{{en-verb|circumscrib|ing}}
# To draw a line around; encircle. 
# To limit narrowly; restrict.
# {{geometry}} To draw a [[circle]], [[sphere]], or higher-dimensional [[ball]] through all the vertices of (a polyhedron, polygon, etc.).

